 "tile_count": 89,
 "about": "Each piece is a metatile: 'tiles' is rows of tile indices into roads_cpc_mode0_sheet.png (w x h tiles). 'connects' lists the sides the piece opens to, in N E S W order: EW/NS = straight, two adjacent letters = bend, three = T junction, NESW = crossing, one letter = dead end open on that side. Straights and zebras are 1 tile long and repeat. Junction pieces 'major_EW+minor_N' join a minor road to a major one; the block is minor-width x major-width. Group 'decor' = drop-in straights with manholes and kerb drains (on the south/east side of streets and avenues, which building shadows never reach) and 'asphalt_manhole', a plain asphalt tile for junction cores.",
 "road_types": {
  "alley": {
   "width_tiles": 1,
   "cross_section_units": "2 footway | 12 cobbles | 2 footway",
   "notes": "no markings, no kerb; one lane"
  },
